{"id":"3ddc1ca53614fbf04fa2c946855250cd728fb221","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234882","title":"claude 20x 昨天被封了，据说 5x 这种没事。该不该换成 gpt20x 呢？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"blackantt","excerpt":"Claude - @blackantt - gpt5.6 比 fable5 到底差多远呢？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>gpt5.6 比 fable5 到底差多远呢？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980546\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a1fd/e6b7/96820_normal.png?m=1785985163\" alt=\"ludongzhou\" data-uid=\"96820\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ludongzhou\">ludongzhou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:09:39 +08:00\">16h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我两个用的都是 5x, 体感是:<br>1. 代码量比较大的工程(几万行): gpt 明显受限 context window, 做出复杂决策的时候 sol 不能有足够的知识, 会有捡了芝麻丢了西瓜的现象, gpt &lt; claude<br>2. 代码量适中的工程: gpt 和 claude 对比没有明显的差别, gpt ≈ claude<br>3. 指令依从性: claude 会自作主张做一些额外的事情, gpt 比较听话, gpt &gt; claude</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980589\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/eba8/5d16/221476_normal.png?m=1497522659\" alt=\"jinue9900\" data-uid=\"221476\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jinue9900\">jinue9900</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:14:44 +08:00\">15h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude 细节把控不如 gpt 但是 gpt 有时候又会过度把控 导致很容易出现小题大做的情况<br>但是整体看下来 gpt 能补齐速度和审美短板 cluade 可能就 G 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980603\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:16:08 +08:00\">15h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jinue9900\">jinue9900</a> gpt5.6 目前的审美还不错，比之前的版本提升很大，基本可以替代 gemini 了，就是速度慢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980779\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d1f2/b9b4/64727_normal.png?m=1786332779\" alt=\"isbase\" data-uid=\"64727\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/isbase\">isbase</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:32:36 +08:00\">15h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>各有各的强处。谁也无法完全代替谁</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980824\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ea75/9dd5/216620_normal.png?m=1738891338\" alt=\"ayyll\" data-uid=\"216620\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ayyll\">ayyll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:36:58 +08:00\">15h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我 20x 用了一周封了  5x 用了 20 多天封了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17980904\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8f42/0a93/693025_normal.png?m=1783858790\" alt=\"Jensond\" data-uid=\"693025\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Jensond\">Jensond</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 10:47:41 +08:00\">15h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>说封照样封你，没商量。不过我用的 Claude 透明代理防火墙之后，2 月了 没封了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981028\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/003f1b50994eb31aeb26105920380e3a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"blackantt\" data-uid=\"215985\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:00:35 +08:00\">15h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Jensond\">Jensond</a> 不是这个原因。 我的环境绝对干净，连中文输入法都没装，时区，系统都是美区的。20x 也被封。   估计就 2 个原因，用了中文问问题，或者卖家的信用卡被连坐了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981104\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4fe/8d8f/639973_normal.png?m=1783846780\" alt=\"EvanClausen\" data-uid=\"639973\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EvanClausen\">EvanClausen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:09:33 +08:00\">15h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a> 是不是用 Fable 问了 反编译/破解/网络安全/生物 类问题？我自己一个用了好几年的号因为这个被秒封了。按你#9 说的“卖家的信用卡”如果是代开，一个卡多个号封的概率只会更大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981145\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4571/ffbc/265735_normal.png?m=1782441383\" alt=\"wu67\" data-uid=\"265735\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wu67\">wu67</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:13:40 +08:00\">14h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没什么用, 监测到在国内大概还是会封. 我们有正经手机号、外国同事、外国办公地点, 在国内用账号也被干掉了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981238\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4fe/8d8f/639973_normal.png?m=1783846780\" alt=\"EvanClausen\" data-uid=\"639973\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EvanClausen\">EvanClausen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:21:26 +08:00\">14h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a> IP 能换就换，浏览器换一个就好了，Claude Code 由于是基于本地运作的，你把他在电脑上对应的 BUN 二进制删掉应该也安全了。但是问题是现在 Anthropic 对新号风控本来就比较严格。我被封了之后，拿新号开了一个 Max ，用了 5 分钟就封了。只用了 5%的 5 小时限额。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981373\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6372d80b2498cdf72a14099a5728ea05?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"coolcoffee\" data-uid=\"112903\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coolcoffee\">coolcoffee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:33:59 +08:00\">14h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大概率是同一张信用卡连坐。 我用 N26 的多张卡片尝试订阅多个账号，结果后面订阅的就被封，前面的没事。 出口 p 和机器都是同一个。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981670\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fdc1/7d75/604582_normal.png?m=1764836993\" alt=\"nnnnnnamgn\" data-uid=\"604582\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nnnnnnamgn\">nnnnnnamgn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:27:34 +08:00\">13h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gpt 只要正常支付，不反代不逆向被封的概率很小；但 5.6 sol 比 fable5 还是差很多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981982\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6372d80b2498cdf72a14099a5728ea05?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"coolcoffee\" data-uid=\"112903\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coolcoffee\">coolcoffee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 13:44:30 +08:00\">12h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a> 应该是可以的。我手上有 apple store 和信用卡订阅两个账号一直共存了几个月都没事，不过 apple 支付对于 5x 和 20x 有溢价不划算。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982475\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3baa/a944/800854_normal.png?m=1779784301\" alt=\"lel020\" data-uid=\"800854\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lel020\">lel020</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 14:53:53 +08:00\">11h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude pro 用了一周，真的比 codex 好用耐用，但是到处都在说封号， 搞的我不敢升级了， 但 pro 是真的不够主力用，</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982624\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/96c6/4d30/102160_normal.png?m=1763018314\" alt=\"bjzhou1990\" data-uid=\"102160\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bjzhou1990\">bjzhou1990</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 15:20:39 +08:00\">10h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>google play / app store 订阅一点事没有，非要在乱七八糟的渠道买不出事才怪</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17983732\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5c43/ef5e/798826_normal.png?m=1786972593\" alt=\"fengshao1227\" data-uid=\"798826\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fengshao1227\">fengshao1227</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 19:13:40 +08:00\">6h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>体感方面 claude 还是最舒服的<br>但如果只是日常工作使用，gpt 已经完全够用，并且超出了，差距不大，w</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17983838\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/30cd/95c7/300733_normal.png?m=1742886447\" alt=\"GLaDOSi\" data-uid=\"300733\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/GLaDOSi\">GLaDOSi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 19:51:18 +08:00\">6h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a> 他说的应该是通过 Goole Play 或者 App Store 直接登陆然后用这些商店绑的余额或者钱包订阅。至于稳不稳我就不知道了，毕竟我之前美国信用卡订的 Claude 1 年左右也封了（不过我怀疑是我爹用的那个垃圾机场问题）。还有个路子是 AWS 的 Bedrock 或者 Azure Foundry ，虽然理论上不会封号但是价格有点感人，而且是配额制，反正我上去只有 4.6 版本的额度，5.0 压根没有。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"gpt5.6 比 fable5 到底差多远呢？ 1 ludongzhou 16h 0m ago 我两个用的都是 5x, 体感是:1. 代码量比较大的工程(几万行): gpt 明显受限 context window, 做出复杂决策的时候 sol 不能有足够的知识, 会有捡了芝麻丢了西瓜的现象, gpt < claude2. 代码量适中的工程: gpt 和 claude 对比没有明显的差别, gpt ≈ claude3. 指令依从性: claude 会自作主张做一些额外的事情, gpt 比较听话, gpt > claude 2 jinue9900 15h 55m ago claude 细节把控不如 gpt 但是 gpt 有时候又会过度把控 导致很容易出现小题大做的情况但是整体看下来 gpt 能补齐速度和审美短板 cluade 可能就 G 了 3 layxy 15h 53m ago @jinue9900 gpt5.6 目前的审美还不错，比之前的版本提升很大，基本可以替代